  "title": "Cobblemon Rivals",
  "description": "Modpack for the popular Minecraft server Cobblemon Rivals",
  "body": "![Rivals](https://i.imgur.com/F5tW3yu.png)\n\nThis Pokémon Minecraft server offers the highest quality and most extensive Cobblemon experience out there!\n\nJoin the public server and dive into Minecraft survival with your very own Pokémon! Catch Pokémon, battle gyms, fight bosses, and so much more! **Check out the Discord and IP below!** \n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n| **Server Version:** | 1.7.3 |\n| :---: | :---: |\n| **Minecraft Version:** | 1.21.1 |\n| **Server Ip:** | play.cobblemonrivals.com |\n\n<br>\n\n[![Cobblemon Rivals Discord](https://i.imgur.com/7l2ScoE.png)](https://discord.gg/dUHHf76vwk)\n[![Cobblemon Rivals Store](https://i.imgur.com/FxzPvIZ.png)](https://store.cobblemonrivals.com)\n[![Cobblemon Wiki](https://i.imgur.com/kQcGbrm.png)](https://wiki.cobblemon.com/index.php/Main_Page)\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FJIEtKY.png\" alt=\"---\">\n</div>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AiJf7tp.png\" alt=\"Server Features\" width=\"400\";\">\n</div>\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A4dolbz.png\" alt=\"Pokémon Mechanics\" width=\"320\">\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n## Mega Evolutions, Dynamax & Terastallization, Z-Moves, Rideable Pokémon, Pokémon with different sizes\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fsCU5s.png\">\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lZnc15F.png\" alt=\"Gameplay & Challenges\" width=\"320\">\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n## Player & NPC Gyms, Ranked Battles & Tournaments, Raid Bosses & Wild Bosses, Legendary Pokémon, Quests & Hunts\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EC9a1Bt.png\">\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hmoNZcg.png\" alt=\"Community & Economy\" width=\"320\">\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n## Active & Friendly Community, GTS & Wondertrade, Markets & Server Shop, Land Claiming, Mailbox\n\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8JpHtQQ.png\">\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gGbZ2T3.png\" alt=\"Survival & Utility\" width=\"320\">\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n## Keep Inventory, Breeding & Daycare, TMs & Move Tutors, Resource World, Fossils\n\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWld4j3.png\">\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FJIEtKY.png\" alt=\"---\">\n</div>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\nCobblemon Rivals is a Cobblemon-themed Minecraft survival server that fosters a welcoming and fun multiplayer experience. **Join us for the adventure!**\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n[![Cobblemon Rivals Discord](https://i.imgur.com/7l2ScoE.png)](https://discord.gg/dUHHf76vwk)\n[![Cobblemon Rivals Store](https://i.imgur.com/FxzPvIZ.png)](https://store.cobblemonrivals.com)\n\n</div>\n",
